### Create a valid product
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dress D",
  "price": 450,
  "stock": 3
}

### Invalid data
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": "cheap",
  "stock": -1
}

### Extra field that is not allowed
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dress E",
  "price": 100,
  "stock": 1,
  "id": 99
}



### Update a product
PATCH http://localhost:3000/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 350
}

### Delete a product
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/3

### Get the deleted product, should be 404
GET http://localhost:3000/products/1


### Invalid id
GET http://localhost:3000/products/abc

### Invalid id on update
PATCH http://localhost:3000/products/abc
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price": 100 }

### Invalid id on delete
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/abc
